
mint head
  case name
    site name
  case list, mint list
    site form
  case draw, mint draw
    site form
  case form, mint form
    site form
  case take, mint take
    site form
  case free
    site free
  case fall
    site fall
  hook make
    make head
      bind name, read name
      bind form, read form
      bind free, read free
      bind fall, read fall

mint base
  case name
    site name
  case list, mint list
    site form
  case draw, mint draw
    site form
  case form, mint form
    site form
  case take, mint take
    site form
  case free
    site free
  case fall
    site fall
  hook make
    make base
      bind name, read name
      bind form, read form
      bind free, read free
      bind fall, read fall

mint list
  case form
    site form
  hook make
    make list
      bind form, read form

mint draw
  case form
    site form
  hook make
    make draw
      bind form, read form

mint free
  case term
    site term
  hook make
    make free
      bind term, read term
